  "releaseNotes": "`PrefixWeightedSequence<T>.CountWhile` counts the items at the start of a sequence for which a test holds, which is the position at which it first does not, by descending the sequence once and testing one item at each level, where finding that position by halves walks the sequence to find each item it tests; it passes the test a state of the caller's so that the caller need not allocate a closure.",
